' v1.2's doctor says before payment what an offer would do
' (`ServiceScene.UpdateDoctorOfferText`, `newburn?64`–`78`; `preset classic
' ai none seed 3 start 0 health 40`: New Sandez, the leader prepared at 40).
' With nothing on the table: "Bring me food, and I'll treat your wounds."
' (`doc_empty`); the meat on it: "For that I can get you back on your feet.
' (+36 HP)" (`doc_offer`); HEAL: 40 -> 76, the gain shown, and v0.9.1's
' line on how it went (`doc_after`). At the cap (95, unprepared) the first
' line is "There's nothing more I can do for you."
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 75,303          ' into New Sandez
wait 60
mapclick 245,231         ' the doctor
wait 150
snap doc_empty
press left               ' the meat
press space              ' onto the table
wait 3
snap doc_offer
press q                  ' HEAL
wait 5
snap doc_after
quit
